<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18375" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφῐλό-τῑμος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lacking in ambition,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Is.
				7.35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lycurg.
				69
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1107b29
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				6.48.8
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίος ἀ. εἰς δόξαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Inscr.Prien.</u>
					112.11
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Eun.
				<u>VS</u>
				p.491
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>
			Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-μως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					12.23.8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς πολίτας ζῆν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.525d
				</span></i>
			; but also, <i>without fear</i> or <i>favour, impartial,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				9(2).517.34
			</span></i> (Epist. Philipp.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> simply, <i>indifferent,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς κάλλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					2.9.6
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-μως</span>”
				<i>lukewarmly,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					PPetr.
					2p.5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of things,
				<i>not honourable, paltry,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἀπὸ μικρῶν δόξα ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.35a
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
